        {
            "id": "dae54573-1c13-45a4-b522-d1b5b4538510",
            "build_id": "0a49cbd6-524f-4408-bcde-afe3d3a57679",
            "round_number": 7,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-09-22T23:38:01.335774+00:00",
            "notes": "## Powers\n\nIn most games, [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228) is the best pick. It makes your ult stronger, adds burst to kill targets, and resets cooldowns on eliminations.  \n\n[Lunar Leap](item_dd41728d-7997-487f-93f5-859b3e9d0c84) and [Moon Landing](item_cc4f210b-31e1-47b2-8400-325afcc4892b) are decent alternatives because of how often you\u2019re jumping.  \n\n[Primal Slam](item_9c54910d-33eb-4b3c-b04c-c9ac9b6f533a) is harder to use but very rewarding if mastered, giving you even more mobility and outplay potential.  \n\n## Items\n\n[Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is excellent for raw WP and is much needed to finish kills.  \n\nI usually don\u2019t recommend replacing [Zero-G Suit](item_404d695a-1c12-47ac-9bc4-00b6e6e985e6) since it\u2019s so valuable. The more replaceable slot is [Weapon Jammer](item_72386db6-753e-413d-aa2a-f1389842f47f), though it\u2019s still very strong at roughly 20% WP. If you do swap it out, go for [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f).  \n\nIf your team already has another source of debuffs like a Moira, you can also replace [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) with either [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) or [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643).  \n\n**Late-game options:**  \n- [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f) is my favorite for a huge stat boost. \n- [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) is the strongest defensive option for survivability.\n- [R\u00fcstung von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) is solid and makes your punches do more damage if you play [Primal Punch](item_3b024d32-8fa1-4713-80ee-e042867f5228).",
